    "long_instructions": "Brand Designers often start by looking at other brands to identify trends and get inspiration for their own designs.\r\n\r\n## Do This:\r\n\r\n1. Compare each pair of websites shown here.\r\n2. In the boxes below each brand, write down what you notice about color, topography, layout, and overall tone.\r\n3. Then, explain who each brand seems to target. Use specific evidence from the design (colors, fonts, imagry, layout) to support your thinking about the intended audience.",
