            "fontSize": 20,
            "fontFamily": 1,
            "text": "What do you notice about the SoundCloud brand?",
            "textAlign": "left",
            "verticalAlign": "top",
            "containerId": null,
            "originalText": "What do you notice about the SoundCloud brand?",
            "lineHeight": 1.25,
            "baseline": 18
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "version": 563,
            "versionNonce": 241096854,
            "isDeleted": false,
            "id": "GY1VeoIzabITXrZwS3u4m",
            "fillStyle": "solid",
            "strokeWidth": 2,
            "strokeStyle": "solid",
            "roughness": 0,
            "opacity": 100,
            "angle": 0,
            "x": 378.10583351698006,
            "y": 16.47637405239858,
            "strokeColor": "#e03131",
            "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
            "width": 432.4166564941406,
            "height": 80,
            "seed": 344216458,
            "groupIds": [

            ],
            "frameId": null,
            "roundness": null,
            "boundElements": [

            ],
            "updated": 1773182018242,
            "link": null,
            "locked": false,
            "fontSize": 16,
            "fontFamily": 1,
            "text": "The Spotify brand ...\n- Dark mode look with neon-like album covers that pop.\n- Modern, clean, and easy to navigate.\n- Feels chill and music-focused. ",
            "textAlign": "left",
            "verticalAlign": "top",
            "containerId": null,
            "originalText": "The Spotify brand ...\n- Dark mode look with neon-like album covers that pop.\n- Modern, clean, and easy to navigate.\n- Feels chill and music-focused. ",
            "lineHeight": 1.25,
            "baseline": 74
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "version": 561,
            "versionNonce": 775104662,
            "isDeleted": false,
            "id": "lY7vgsdujsthf7z3SWIZm",
            "fillStyle": "solid",
            "strokeWidth": 2,
            "strokeStyle": "solid",
            "roughness": 0,
            "opacity": 100,
            "angle": 0,
            "x": 858.2174057826048,
            "y": 14.897589277305325,
            "strokeColor": "#e03131",
            "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
            "width": 543.2083129882812,
            "height": 80,
            "seed": 612717130,
            "groupIds": [

            ],
            "frameId": null,
            "roundness": null,
            "boundElements": [

            ],
            "updated": 1773182081565,
            "link": null,
            "locked": false,
            "fontSize": 16,
            "fontFamily": 1,
            "text": "The SoundCloud brand ... \n- Uses gray and black tones with big, bold text.\n- Focuses on creators — “upload” and “create account” stand out.\n- Feels more indie and raw than Spotify.",
            "textAlign": "left",
            "verticalAlign": "top",
            "containerId": null,
            "originalText": "The SoundCloud brand ... \n- Uses gray and black tones with big, bold text.\n- Focuses on creators — “upload” and “create account” stand out.\n- Feels more indie and raw than Spotify.",
            "lineHeight": 1.25,
            "baseline": 74
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "version": 600,
            "versionNonce": 2068081686,
            "isDeleted": false,
            "id": "M_urrXCbvN5XA-Ie4RlJV",
            "fillStyle": "solid",
            "strokeWidth": 2,
            "strokeStyle": "solid",
            "roughness": 0,
            "opacity": 100,
            "angle": 0,
            "x": 369.3603326799264,
            "y": 196.22115682024798,
            "strokeColor": "#e03131",
            "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
            "width": 414.4166564941406,
            "height": 80,
            "seed": 1903720714,
            "groupIds": [

            ],
            "frameId": null,
            "roundness": null,
            "boundElements": [

            ],
            "updated": 1773182813073,
            "link": null,
            "locked": false,
            "fontSize": 16,
            "fontFamily": 1,
            "text": "It seems like Spotify's target audience is \nTeens and young adults who listen to music a lot. \nThe dark theme makes the album covers stand out \nand feel modern.",
            "textAlign": "left",
            "verticalAlign": "top",
            "containerId": null,
            "originalText": "It seems like Spotify's target audience is \nTeens and young adults who listen to music a lot. \nThe dark theme makes the album covers stand out \nand feel modern.",
            "lineHeight": 1.25,
            "baseline": 74
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "version": 708,
            "versionNonce": 407903830,
            "isDeleted": false,
            "id": "gFzkrqZo7IzFgD1xBoIBz",
            "fillStyle": "solid",
            "strokeWidth": 2,
            "strokeStyle": "solid",
            "roughness": 0,
            "opacity": 100,
            "angle": 0,
            "x": 850.4049580984533,
            "y": 202.00685366734626,
            "strokeColor": "#e03131",
            "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
            "width": 494.4166564941406,
            "height": 80,
            "seed": 1792591818,
            "groupIds": [

            ],
            "frameId": null,
            "roundness": null,
            "boundElements": [

            ],
            "updated": 1773182835258,
            "link": null,
            "locked": false,
            "fontSize": 16,
            "fontFamily": 1,
            "text": "It seems like SoundCloud's target audience is \nIndependent artists and people who like discovering new music. \nThe focus on uploading and creators makes it feel more \nfor musicians.",
            "textAlign": "left",
            "verticalAlign": "top",
            "containerId": null,
            "originalText": "It seems like SoundCloud's target audience is \nIndependent artists and people who like discovering new music. \nThe focus on uploading and creators makes it feel more \nfor musicians.",
            "lineHeight": 1.25,
            "baseline": 74
          },
